# Web UI

Vite + React on port 5173. One screen in `App.tsx`: query textarea, Ask, Ingest, route, answer, citations, tool trace. No router, no auth UI, no component library.

The client talks only to the local API (`VITE_API_URL`, default `http://localhost:8787`) through `src/api.ts`. Do not import `apps/api` source. Response shapes (`QueryResult`, `IngestResult`) live in `src/shared/types.ts`. `API_URL` and `DEFAULT_QUERY` live in `src/shared/constants.ts`.

`errorMessage` stays in `src/api.ts` next to `queryAgent` and `ingestKnowledge`. Do not add `src/utils.ts` for that one function.

```tsx
// Bad: import { AgentResult } from "../../api/src/domain/types"
// Bad: apps/web/src/utils.ts exporting only errorMessage
// Good: import type { QueryResult } from "./shared/types"
```
